# Smaug, Wicked Worm: "Whenever you cast a spell, if mana from a Treasure was spent to cast it" - only its controller's spells.
# Bot2 makes a Treasure with Deadly Dispute (sacrificing an Ornithopter) on turn 2; Bot1 casts Smaug on turn 3, and at its end
# step Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1 paid with its Treasure's mana. Smaug does not trigger: Bot1 takes the 3 damage, loses no
# more life and draws no card.

